233 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The first Jaipur Debate in 2014 witnessed the inception of young minds engaged in rigorous debates on pressing global issues. Over this past decade, competition has evolved, making the Jaipur Debate an indispensable event in this community. The platform has posed as an instrument allowing participants to grow and develop their orating skills, challenge the status quo and engage in stimulating discussions with their teammates. The Jaipur Debate holds a special place in our hearts. It celebrates intellectual engagement and teamwork, and acts as a haven for like-minded individuals to get together and converse on provocative ideas. In the course of these three days, we see team mates, we see friends, and we see the future leaders of our world. Rivals but not foes, the debaters foster friendships with each other at every given chance.  The 11th edition of the Jaipur Debate not only acts as a milestone but also as a testament proving the power of debate in shaping minds and enhancing public speaking. Looking back on the last three days in joy, we look forward to future editions to achieve new heights!)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
