256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In a compelling debate between the Proposition, La Matiniere Girls, and the Opposition, Shriram millennium Farida, the motion to change from a world where games are subscription based to one where games are free to play with microtransactions ignited an intense discussion centering around the economical, ethical and social impacts of digital entertainment.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
