258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (On the other hand, the Opposition took a stance supporting games that are free to download but make money from small, optional purchases inside the game. They asserted that these games offer wider accessibility and the fact that there is no barrier of an upfront cost allows more people to explore their interests and try out different games without any financial commitment. The Opposition then reinforced the economic benefits that micro-transactions in games offer, by delving into how more jobs are created for those who work to design avatars, items and features that players choose to purchase in these games. While this direct link to higher tertiary employment was considered, they also addressed the idea of games with micro-transactions being a better value for money. They )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
